flowchart LR
    dev[Developer / 开发者]
    browser[Browser / 浏览器]
    web[Web dev process / Web 开发进程\nReact + Vite]
    gateway[Gateway process / Gateway 进程\nGo]
    core[Core process / Core 进程\nC++]
    agent[Agent process / Agent 进程\nPython]
    db[(Local PostgreSQL / 本地 PostgreSQL)]
    model[External model provider / 外部模型供应商\noptional, credentials required / 可选，需凭据]
    dev --> web
    dev --> gateway
    dev --> core
    dev --> agent
    browser --> web --> gateway
    gateway --> core
    gateway --> agent
    core --> db
    agent -.->|optional / 可选| model
